# Usernames whose posts this sentinel must NEVER downvote.
#
# Copy to `never_downvote.txt` (gitignored) and edit. One username per line.
# Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored; a leading `@` is stripped;
# matching is case-insensitive. Re-read automatically on change — no
# restart needed, even in webhook mode.
#
# This list only suppresses downvotes. To also stop upvotes, add the same
# name to `never_upvote.txt`. It does NOT suppress the other moderation
# actions (JUNK marking, sandbox moves, ad/PII flags) — use `--no-vote`
# to stop those.

# trusted-human       # never auto-penalise, escalate to me instead
# jorwhol
